## Implementation Plan
Use `### Slice N: <observable outcome>` subsections. Every slice must include `Outcome`, `Owners`, `Entry point`, `Core behavior`, `Boundary integration`, `Tests`, `Acceptance command`, and `Complete when`. `Owners` is a JSON string array of names from the reviewed map. `Acceptance command` is a JSON string array that runs the corrected observable path. Architecture is decomposed by responsibility; correction proceeds in vertical slices through those shared owners. A slice must not create a private copy of another owner's behavior.

